{
  "slug": "project-artifact",
  "name": "Project Artifact",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generate and publish a living project status page — overview & success criteria, the workstream sequence, and next steps — as a shareable claude.ai artifact backed by a per-project config, so refreshes re-gather live state, redeploy the same URL, and report only the delta.",
  "longDescription": "Builds a living status page for a multi-workstream project — one tabbed, self-contained HTML file (overview and success criteria, the workstream sequence, an always-visible next-steps strip) published with Claude Code's built-in `Artifact` tool to a private `claude.ai` page you can share. Saying \"refresh the artifact\" in a later session re-gathers live state, redeploys the same URL and reports only the delta; PR-driven projects pull live PR/CI state through the `gh` CLI. Needs a claude.ai login.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
